   "html": "<p class=\"example-expl\">The board already had two queens (Q\u2665 Q\u2666). Your Q\u2660 combined with them to make three of a kind \u2014 you only needed that one card from your hand. Your other hole card (2\u2666) is worse than the board's J\u2663 and 9\u2660, so your final five is three queens plus J\u2663 and 9\u2660 as kickers. This is what \"pairing the board\" looks like.</p>"
  },
