   "title": "The five community cards are all hearts, so the board itself is a flus",
   "groups": {
    "[class*=hole]": [],
    "[class*=board]": [],
    "[class*=best]": [],
    "[class*=dim]": [],
    "[class*=ring]": []
   },
   "html": "<p class=\"example-expl\">The five community cards are all hearts, so the board itself is a flush \u2014 and a flush beats anything your 3\u2663 and 4\u2660 can make. Your best five-card hand IS the board, so you literally play all five community cards and ignore both hole cards completely. This is legal: your hand is the best 5 of your 7 cards, even when the best 5 come entirely from the middle.</p>"
  },
