   "html": "<p class=\"example-expl\">Same board as Player A. Player B also pairs the board's kings and also has an ace, so after comparing K-K-A on both sides, Player B's next card is the 8\u2665 while Player A had a 9\u2666. One card \u2014 the kicker \u2014 is the whole difference. Player A's hand (K-K-A-9-8) beats Player B's hand (K-K-A-8-7).</p>"
